WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
You have now reached the later update, after writing your first brief.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.800
Lindiwe keeps preparation, the decision meeting, the virtual client discussion and the

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.200
private block. She authorises asking operations, rather than assuming operations has agreed.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.317
Operations then accepts its assignment, and the client confirms the original virtual

00:00:21.317 --> 00:00:26.233
arrangement. Finance supplies the approved paper; its version is checked before preparation.

00:00:26.233 --> 00:00:31.150
These are separate evidence events.

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:35.858
The afternoon visit stays within its accepted scope. Later, Aisha accepts a

00:00:35.858 --> 00:00:40.383
defined administrative cover period, while the assigned room duty holder separately confirms

00:00:40.383 --> 00:00:44.908
the relevant monitoring record.
